# Per-case run results land here, one JSON per case, written as each case
# finishes. This directory is the run archive — a .docx can always be rebuilt
# from it, which is why the generated Word documents are gitignored and these
# are not.
#
# Deliberately one file per case rather than one accumulating manifest:
# Playwright restarts its worker after a failed test and resets module state, so
# an in-memory array loses every case recorded before the first failure. Three of
# the nine cases here are expected to fail, so that is not hypothetical.
